    "description": "Read the runtime-inventory Capture that triggered the Line (security.runtime-inventory-v1) for the Line's scope (parameter scope) and propose what changed: each asset by key and asset.scanned_in the scope's coverage, each release it runs (by product name and version, with its purl as release.component) as asset.runs; a full scan retires runs it no longer sees (of the products it looked for) and restates the coverage revision (an unchanged scan re-observes it: freshness moves, nothing is proposed). For each open patch of a scanned asset: verification verified when a full scan shows the affected release no longer running, failed when it is claimed completed and a scan still shows it. A CycloneDX SBOM of one asset (metadata properties cruxible.scope, cruxible.asset) reads as that asset's complete run set, never as the scope's coverage. Halts other_scope for another scope's scan, no_change when nothing changed. Runs as a Line with trigger_input inventory.",
